\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  There is a permanent rest for us
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0 We who are God's genuine children.
\par This is the hope which all of us have,
\par And it shall surely come to pass.
\par I beseech Thee Oh my God that
\par Let me reach that Thy peaceful home.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  There we have an everlasting rest;
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0 There also that we have our peace.
\par Many are trials and tribulations,
\par But in Canaan, there's no trouble.
\par In all our deeds, we beseech Thee
\par Take us into that peaceful rest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   Here, we are wandering on the desert;
\par \pard\li360\sl202\slmult0\qj It is evil and death only.
\par Our Lord Jesus, please kindly save us;
\par For Thou art a Joshua for us
\par To Thee Thy children are crying.
\par Take us into that peaceful rest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   Take us as those who believe in Thee
\par \pard\li360\sl202\slmult0 As we fully depend on Thee.
\par Thy spirit make all of us long for
\par That good and genuine restful home.
\par With faith we cry unto Thee that,
\par \pard       Let us reach that Thy peaceful home.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

